{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_kroos_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_kroos_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "蘋果",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_kroos_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "4511524e057476d3586608a99a6de3e3ac37e842952581871acf093e000b7975",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "某個閒暇清晨\n羅德島主艦"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "我怎麼又被克洛絲繞進去了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "別生氣啦，隊長，克洛絲沒有惡意的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "不是生氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "就是——明明我在監督她幹活，怎麼每次......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "她只是想多放鬆一會啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "下次還是你盯著克洛絲吧，她好像比較聽你的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "我也沒做什麼啦，就是盯著她幹活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "如果她有事情，我就幫她一起幹，過一會她就不讓我做了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "就這樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "嗯，沒什麼特別的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "不愧是你啊，米格魯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "也不知道為什麼，她只要想偷懶，我就攔不住......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "有時候是肚子不舒服、有時候杜賓教官找，我怎麼就信了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "等我反應過來，人已經溜掉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "克洛絲！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "可算讓我找到你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "別跑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "米格魯你去那邊堵她！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "唉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "好，好的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "呼，呼呼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "克洛絲，跟我回去值日！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "（我就休息一下嘛！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "站住！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "（呀，芬怎麼越跑越快了！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "（我得想個辦法。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "您還想聽點什麼嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稀音",
      "speakerId": "char_336_Scene",
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "好的，鏡頭在曲庫裡搜尋一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "（是稀音嗎？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "（嗯......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "（好，試試看吧。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "您好~"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "啊，克洛絲小姐您好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "我可以坐在稀音旁邊嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "哦——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "小姐說她不介意，請坐吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "謝謝~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "呼，呼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "您好像很累的樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "因為，後面有一隻庫蘭塔在追呀~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "克洛絲！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "啊，我也聽到了，是芬小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "其實我和芬在捉迷藏呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "結果抓著抓著，就變成賽跑了~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "鏡頭，幫幫忙吧~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "哦——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稀音",
      "speakerId": "char_336_Scene",
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "小姐說聽上去很有趣，讓鏡頭給克洛絲小姐提供幫助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "謝謝~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "但是，我沒法保證您不被芬小姐認出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "要是真被抓住，那我也就只好乖乖認輸啦~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "既然您都這麼說了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "嗶嗶！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "M.P.M一號",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "嘀——嘀——嘀——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "M.P.M二號",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "叮咚！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "（這些小車一直都藏在旁邊嗎，我都沒發現呢。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "嗶嗶！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "M.P.M一號",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "嘀——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "M.P.M二號",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "叮咚叮咚！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "剛剛應該是在這裡跳了一下就不見了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "這傢伙越來越會躲了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稀音",
      "speakerId": "char_336_Scene",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "如果是克洛絲的話......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "應該會——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "藏在——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "芬——我看到克洛絲往食堂那邊去了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "好，我這就來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "呼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "恭喜，看來克洛絲小姐沒有被抓住呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "以前在出任務的時候看到過稀音的藏身手法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "果然很厲害呢~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "鏡頭使用的是最新研製的複合隱蔽技術，融合了迷彩、光線折射等多種科技。主要是為了滿足小姐的需求。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稀音",
      "speakerId": "char_336_Scene",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "對不起小姐，忘記給您播放音樂了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "那麼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "哈——真好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "我也在這裡休息一會，可以嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稀音",
      "speakerId": "char_336_Scene",
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "歡迎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "說起來，稀音小姐現在在做什麼呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "小姐在構思作品。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "雖然看上去只是在發呆，但小姐這時候的確是在思考。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "這時候鏡頭就負責給小姐放音樂和遞食物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "沒有人會追著稀音小姐幹活嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "從鏡頭的記錄裡來看——好像沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "如果有的話，鏡頭就會為小姐使用隱蔽技術，沒人能找得到她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "真好~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "如果我也能像稀音一樣生活就好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "小姐好像也說過類似的話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "好像是：“能夠像卡特斯那樣生活就好了。”——之類的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "卡特斯有什麼好嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "很累的~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "從小到大都被人說，卡特斯不是應該活潑好動嗎，你怎麼就這麼懶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "但我就是想把腦袋放空，然後在沙發上待一天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "這樣不是很好嗎~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稀音",
      "speakerId": "char_336_Scene",
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "小姐說，克洛絲有選擇的權力，已經很幸福了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "用鏡頭來打個比方吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "鏡頭抓拍的速度是很快的，經過系統輔助運算，就算是飛奔的庫蘭塔，鏡頭也能抓拍成功然後把照片放進相冊裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "但小姐是做不到的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "就算是拍攝人物，小姐也要像畫素描一樣，等——上很久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "所以小姐景物拍得好，並不是因為小姐只喜歡景物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "小姐什麼都想拍，但她能拍到的，只有近乎靜止的東西，只有它們，才有耐心一直等在那裡，等著小姐拍完。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "這就是原因。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "克洛絲雖然不喜歡動，但真正活動起來，還是很敏捷的吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "算是吧~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "鏡頭和卡達編輯過有克洛絲參加的作戰記錄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "平常都是在預定地點附近，但是要求來了也可以很迅速地轉移，和普通的卡特斯沒什麼區別。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "那只是因為不好好幹就沒命了嘛~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "任務很辛苦的~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "可沒有鏡頭幫忙，稀音小姐連轉移都做不到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "“做不到”和“不想做”，鏡頭覺得還是有些區別的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "“太多的事情做不了，所以就讓我們把能做的事做到最好。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "稀音小姐是這麼和鏡頭說的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "當然了，小姐能做到的事其實也比較少，做起來也比較方便。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "對於克洛絲來說，是不是因為知道自己的極限，所以只把精力放在最需要自己努力的地方呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "有可能哦~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "看來鏡頭的判斷是正確的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "也有可能只是不想幹活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "鏡頭相信克洛絲小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "滋，滋滋——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "啊，不好意思，這裡信號不太好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "鏡頭剛剛為您選選取的勵勵志程式運行出錯了了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "您看需不需不需要要要要要——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "唉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "鏡頭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "（旁邊的小車也不動了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "（這是，壞了？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稀音",
      "speakerId": "char_336_Scene",
      "text": "——!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "稀音，你是要說什麼嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稀音",
      "speakerId": "char_336_Scene",
      "text": "呣——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "慢慢來，我聽著呢~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稀音",
      "speakerId": "char_336_Scene",
      "text": "唔——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稀音",
      "speakerId": "char_336_Scene",
      "text": "欸——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "我猜猜~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "唔，是——梅爾嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稀音",
      "speakerId": "char_336_Scene",
      "text": "是————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "我知道啦，我去找梅爾，稀音就在這裡守著鏡頭吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "不會過太久的~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "一會見~"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稀音",
      "speakerId": "char_336_Scene",
      "text": "是————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稀音",
      "speakerId": "char_336_Scene",
      "text": "的————"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "不好意思啊芬，我認錯人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "萊恩哈特先生和克洛絲差別還是挺大的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "雖然都是卡特斯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "真的很抱歉，一著急看錯了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "沒事，我們重新找找看，如果找不到，就去請流星小姐或者遠山小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "克洛絲逃不掉的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "今天隊長好像對克洛絲特別有意見呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "平時不也是睜一隻眼閉一隻眼的嗎，今天好像特別生氣的樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "不是生氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "今天克洛絲開溜的時候和我說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "和你說？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "說今天是我帶領大家的周年紀念日，想先給我買點禮物去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "那不是很好嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "結果她一出門就沒回來，等你回宿舍我才反應過來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "今天真的是紀念日嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "是的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "那克洛絲也太過分了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "一會我會幫你說說她的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "啊對了，隊長，周年快樂！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "啊，嗯嗯，謝謝你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "唉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "剛剛那個，是不是克洛絲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "還是我又看錯了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "是克洛絲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "她好像有急事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "走，我們去看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "梅爾的宿舍兼“魯特拉工作室”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "應該是這裡了~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "（這應該是自動門啊，怎麼沒開？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "梅爾小姐，您在嗎~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "（哦——）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "（門壞了啊。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "（是按這邊的按鈕嗎？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "梅爾小姐~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "有些事情想要麻煩你，可以嗎~"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "梅，咳，咳咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊，找我嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哎呀我開循環扇了啊怎麼濃度還這麼高。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我這裡在上漆呢，你先出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我這邊先收個尾，一會就好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "哦，咳，咳咳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "咳咳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "呼，呼——哈——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "說吧，什麼事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "如果是那種修修補補的活，你直接去工程部吧，找我沒用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "咳，是這樣的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "哦——鏡頭當機了，那不是應該找可露希爾嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "稀音好像覺得找您比較合適~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "也行吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "還好我今天沒什麼特別緊急的事，不然你真的要白跑一趟了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "記住啦，以後那些四輪智慧機械出什麼問題，優先找可露希爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "我知道了~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "那我們走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "嗯——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "克洛絲好像真的有事欸！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "我們回去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "唉，不跟著克洛絲了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "有事的話，就不打擾她了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "把克洛絲的爛攤子收拾一下，我們就去吃點好吃的吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "好的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "就在這裡~"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "哎呀走慢一點，我還沒吃早飯呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "稀音小姐~"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稀音",
      "speakerId": "char_336_Scene",
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "鏡頭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "你好呀克洛絲小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "哎呀，梅爾小姐也來啦，歡迎歡迎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "這不是好好的嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "啊......嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "其實您剛一走鏡頭就重啟了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "因為鏡頭有些功能容易出錯，重啟還是很常見的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "那......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "啊您是說小姐嗎？小姐想和您說的是：“沒事的。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "可能小姐的音調太——長，導致您誤會她的意思了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "是，這樣啊~"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稀音",
      "speakerId": "char_336_Scene",
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "那我不是白跑一趟嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "不好意思啦梅爾小姐，鏡頭健康得很。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "嗯，我看看......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "應該不是外部的問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "之前的確當機了對吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "那就是機體本身存在問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "剛剛你自己也說，重啟很常見，對嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "可露希爾怎麼沒幫你解決這問題？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "可露希爾小姐已經為鏡頭預訂了更新配件，再過不久就可以升級了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "哦？哦——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "那批零件原來是給你的啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "昨天我去她小黑屋的時候她還跟我裝了半天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "說是什麼“高級移動攝影器材在極端條件下使用的精尖零件”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "原來就是你啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "那正好，我們現在就去可露希爾那裡一趟，我和她一起幫你解決這個問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "這樣你出任務的時候就不存在當場當機的可能性了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "感謝您，梅爾小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "但小姐她行動不太方便，鏡頭要和小姐一起走，可能沒辦法直接和您去可露希爾小姐那裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "我會帶她慢慢過去的~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "可以吧，稀音小姐~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稀音",
      "speakerId": "char_336_Scene",
      "text": "嗯——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "既然小姐都這麼說了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "speakerId": "char_242_mayer",
      "text": "嗯，那就出發吧，早點收工，我能早睡一會，明天還有一大堆活要幹呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_145",
      "text": "哎呀梅爾小姐，不要推著我跑啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稀音",
      "speakerId": "char_336_Scene",
      "text": "嗯——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "沒事的，梅爾小姐只是性子比較急~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "我們就慢慢晃過去好了~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "我認路的~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稀音",
      "speakerId": "char_336_Scene",
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "行動預備組A1宿舍"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "我回來啦~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "回來啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "芬，這是給你買的甜點~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "紀念日快樂！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "哇，是小瑪芬！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "放桌上就好，明天一起分著吃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "好的~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "浴室有人用嗎~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "我們都上床啦，就剩你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
      "text": "好~"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "你看嘛芬，克洛絲真的努力了一天哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "而且給你買了禮物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "啊——嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "其實我也不是想責怪她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "她要是真的想休息，和我說，我也不會拒絕的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "但她總是用那種方法，有時候是讓我有點不開心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "克洛絲只是不好意思說出口啦，她人很好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "我覺得她是在耍我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "那是因為和你關係好嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "克洛絲對大多數人都不會這樣的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "唉，那我寧願她對我正常點......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "早點睡吧，我們明天還要訓練呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "記得起來以後叫醒克洛絲，她回來的時候看上去確實很疲憊，我怕她明天起不來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "要是真睡過頭，杜賓教官......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "安心啦芬，我會把她拖起來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "但願如此......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "唔，不想了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "睡覺睡覺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
      "text": "晚安。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
      "text": "晚安，隊長。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
